WEBVTT

00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:01.400
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Part 4

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:08.702
<v><b>William:</b></v> The windmill’s frame weighed about 90lb,

00:00:09.048 --> 00:00:15.859
and I knew the only way we would get it to the top of the tower we’d built was to use a rope and pulley.

00:00:16.986 --> 00:00:20.211
I used my mother’s thick clothesline wire instead.

00:00:22.058 --> 00:00:25.048
We fastened it to the windmill’s bamboo handle.

00:00:26.729 --> 00:00:32.472
Taking the other end, I climbed the tower and hooked the wire over the top rung,

00:00:32.779 --> 00:00:34.722
then dropped it down to Gilbert.

00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:40.189
Geoffrey stood below on the middle rungs to guide the machine as it went up.

00:00:41.155 --> 00:00:47.878
Standing there, I could see over the acacia tree to where the fields joined the highlands.

00:00:48.732 --> 00:00:52.685
‘OK, Gilbert,’ I yelled. ‘Bring it up!’

00:00:55.562 --> 00:00:57.964
Carefully, he pulled the wire.

00:00:58.949 --> 00:01:05.241
First, the windmill’s handle lifted, then the frame rose and wobbled.

00:01:06.354 --> 00:01:10.849
Little by little, the windmill made its way up the tower.

00:01:12.183 --> 00:01:19.157
With each pull, it swung and banged its cumbersome blades against the tower’s wood frame.

00:01:20.971 --> 00:01:26.183
When the handle came within reach, I grabbed hold and screamed, ‘Tie it down!’ …

00:01:27.064 --> 00:01:31.425
Once the windmill was fastened, we looked at each other and smiled.

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:38.283
It felt sturdy and very strong. Sweat poured down my face.

00:01:38.856 --> 00:01:41.584
I could hardly wait to watch the blades spin.

00:01:43.071 --> 00:01:47.956
While Geoffrey made his way down the tower, I remained atop my perch.

00:01:49.182 --> 00:01:54.325
To the north, I could see the iron- sheet roofs of the trading centre

00:01:54.778 --> 00:01:58.566
and the brown row of huts that sat behind the main road.

00:01:59.505 --> 00:02:03.145
Then something strange began to happen...